---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Bend Oregon SEO Consultant | SEO Services in Bend, OR"
  description="SEO consulting and organic search strategy for Bend, Oregon businesses that want better rankings, more visibility, stronger local search performance, and more qualified leads."
>
  <main>
    <section class="seo-page-hero">
      <div class="container seo-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Bend Oregon SEO Services</p>
          <h1>SEO help for Bend businesses that want to get found.</h1>
          <p class="hero-text">
            I help Bend businesses improve Google visibility, local search performance,
            website structure, content strategy, and search-driven leads.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/contact/" class="primary-btn">Contact Me About Bend SEO</a>
            <a href="/services/ai-search" class="secondary-btn">AI Search Strategy</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="seo-hero-card">
          <p class="card-label">Local SEO Focus</p>
          <div class="seo-checklist">
            <span>Google Search</span>
            <span>Google Maps</span>
            <span>Service Pages</span>
            <span>Local Content</span>
            <span>Technical SEO</span>
            <span>Lead Tracking</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-services-modern">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="section-label">What I help with</p>
          <h2>Practical SEO support for local businesses.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="service-grid three">
          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-number">01</span>
            <h3>Local SEO Strategy</h3>
            <p>
              Improve how your business appears for Bend-area searches, map results,
              service terms, and high-intent local keywords.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-number">02</span>
            <h3>Website SEO</h3>
            <p>
              Strengthen title tags, page structure, internal links, headings,
              crawlability, and the signals search engines use to understand your site.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-number">03</span>
            <h3>Content Planning</h3>
            <p>
              Build service pages, location pages, guides, and supporting content
              that bring in people looking for exactly what you offer.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-content-modern">
      <div class="container content-grid">
        <div class="content-main">
          <p class="section-label">Bend SEO Consultant</p>
          <h2>SEO consulting for Bend, Oregon businesses</h2>
          <p>
            Bend is competitive. Whether you run a local service business, outdoor brand,
            real estate business, healthcare practice, restaurant, tourism company, or
            professional service firm, people are searching before they call, book, visit, or buy.
          </p>

          <p>
            My work focuses on helping your website become clearer, more useful, and easier to find.
            That can include local SEO, technical fixes, better page structure, new content,
            keyword research, reporting, and practical search strategy tied to business goals.
          </p>

          <h2>Good fit for businesses that want more than rankings</h2>
          <p>
            Rankings matter, but they are not the whole point. The real goal is getting in front
            of the right people and helping them take the next step. I look at search visibility,
            page quality, user intent, conversion paths, and how SEO supports revenue.
          </p>

          <h2>Work with a Bend-based SEO consultant</h2>
          <p>
            I live in Central Oregon and understand how people search for local businesses here.
            That helps when building pages around Bend neighborhoods, nearby towns, seasonal demand,
            tourism, outdoor activities, and local service searches.
          </p>

          <a class="primary-btn dark-btn" href="/contact/">Contact Me About Bend SEO</a>
        </div>

        <aside class="content-side-card">
          <h3>What I can help with</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Local SEO for Bend-area searches</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile strategy</li>
            <li>SEO audits and technical cleanup</li>
            <li>Service page planning</li>
            <li>Keyword and content strategy</li>
            <li>Internal linking improvements</li>
            <li>Organic traffic and lead reporting</li>
            <li>AI search visibility strategy</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
